# /static's CONTENTS are ignored one level at a time (not the directory
# itself recursively) specifically so the exception below can actually
# take effect — Git never descends into an excluded directory tree even
# with a nested "!" rule, so "/static" (recursive) + "!/static/X/**"
# silently does nothing; "/static/*" (single level) leaves the directory
# itself visible to Git, letting the re-include below reach its contents.
/static/*
# Exception: I/O List's repo-committed default symbol picture library must
# ship with the code (see apps/instrument_io_workflow/services/seed_default_
# symbols.py) — everything else directly under /static (collected static
# output, other apps' own default-symbol folders) stays ignored as before.
!/static/io_list_default_symbols/
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

